{"parse": {"title": "10TH-10", "pageid": 105713, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-09\" title=\"10TH-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">10TH-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-11\" title=\"10TH-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">10TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8D.92.E9.87.8E.E7.9A.84.E5.91.BC.E5.94.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"荒野的呼唤\">荒野的呼唤</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 荒野的呼唤</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Call of the Wild</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>灵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>性<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>微<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>外<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11010</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>奇怪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诺谛卡低头看着自己的地图，又抬头看向周围的雪坡与山脉。反复几次，试图寻找熟悉的地标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我们……迷路了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我的队伍曾两次深入到遗址外围，入口应该就在附近没有错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家紧张地搓着手指，手套沙沙作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-312010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>维尔汀，对不起……这里的地形和我印象中的完全不一样了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>顺便一提，我已经接收不到任何来自基金会的射频信号了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-524416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-524416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-524416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>没有明显地标，指南针失灵，地形与地图无法对应，接收不到信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，我们现在怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_nanjibingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精力充沛的犬队只趴在雪里休息了片刻，便开始追逐起了彼此的尾巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312025.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312025.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>嘿、嘿！不许抢我的手表，它可不是狗狗能玩的东西，去、去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诺谛卡珍惜地擦了擦古董手表表面的口水，把它收进了包里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>群犬像乌洛波洛斯的环一样玩闹了起来，发出了快乐的呜咽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我有主意了，我想我们并不需要舍近求远……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嘘——！来，看我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-524411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-524411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-524411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>德洛丝医生的听诊器？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>原来如此，我明白了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-524410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>抛开雪橇犬的工作属性，它们还有犬科动物的本质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，让它们熟悉听诊器上残留的气味，说不定能找到她离去的方向……让我们祈祷这能奏效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领头犬放过了伙伴湿漉漉的尾巴，低头嗅闻起了听诊器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雪橇犬：</div><div>汪——！呜汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>它们有反应了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>快爬上它们的背。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_xueyuan1\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_xueyuan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_xueyuan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太阳不再落下，腹地的白昼被拉长到了永恒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>失去参照物的移动在白色大地上似乎失去了意义，<br />正如无人知道雪橇犬在急停前奔驰了多长时间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>我们成功了！这儿就是我的队伍曾经到过的地方！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拉起缰绳，犬队随训而停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-529201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-529201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-529201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">耳朵虫：</div><div>&lt;glitch&gt;“引路人的出现转瞬即逝，虔诚者若已在路上，请吹响同路的歌谣。”&lt;/glitch&gt;</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-312011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>小耳朵虫说得对，地母的指引没有错！和你们一起上路果然是正确的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同行者纷纷跳下犬背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……我们这是在哪里？山谷里的迷宫？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>弗里莱相信这里是遗址外围，只要穿过这个山谷，我们就能在隘口后找到真正的遗址——一座神庙，甚至可能是一座城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>快看这石壁，上面有人工开凿的痕迹——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>上次队伍到这儿时撞上了反常的白化气候，那些雪雾让我们什么都没看到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家奔向最近的石壁，蹲下，摘下手套，用人类温暖的掌心抚摸冰封的岩石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我从来没有见过这种岩石，是某种化石吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312025.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312025.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312025.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312025.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>是拉斑玄武岩，它们诞生在深海之底的大洋中脊，你瞧这些几何形的气孔和金色的矿物纹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312026.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312026.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>它们出现在陆地上，弗里莱会说这是四亿两千五百万年时间变迁下的奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312026.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312026.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-312026.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312026.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>弗里莱，弗里莱……她加入我们的队伍，就是为了在南极洲找到一块这样的石头，哪怕只有掌心大小……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家垂下头，悄悄把石头捂热后揣进口袋里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像将其视为某种珍视的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵轻微的震颤，神秘术的波动消失在飞散的霰雪中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本能地向着那个方向迈出两步，步伐停止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-524415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线被另一侧石壁下凸起的雪堆所吸引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不是错觉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蹲下身子，拂去上面的积雪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_caxue\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_caxue\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_caxue2\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_caxue2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_caxue2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_daziji\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_daziji\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_daziji.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一台便携式古典打字机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-524401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我在档案里见过这台打字机……白朗姆女士和娜娜都曾描述过它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这个时代，它印出过落水者简短的病历，参与了圣保罗喧闹的夜晚，也见证了乌斯怀亚的小小社会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>没错——德洛丝医生的打字机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-524412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-524412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-524412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>又一件属于她的物品……是否过于巧合了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_tansuo1\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_tansuo1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"5244114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"5244114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>咳、咳咳……上面沾了一层什么？鳞粉？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_tansuo3\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_tansuo3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png/900px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_at_tansuo3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"5244114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"5244114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>血迹，已经干透了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>企鹅，海豹，科考站里的遇难者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血迹可能属于任何人，也可能来自德洛丝医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不管是有人故意引导还是单纯的巧合，至少这证明了我们的方向是对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"5244114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"5244114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-5244114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-5244114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>上面的血迹……德洛丝医生可能受伤了，我们得尽快找到她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都聚了过来，包括躺在雪橇犬身上的无线电小姐。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光秃秃的山体屹立两侧，林立的玄武岩石壁迷宫般镇守在隘口前，迷宫的尽头也被薄雾掩藏着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雪橇犬：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>领头犬凑了过来，似乎有什么发现一般地抬起头，警惕地望向某个方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雪橇犬：</div><div>汪——！汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>等等！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无线电小姐：</div><div>——天啊！你们要带我去哪儿？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>停下！停下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>探险家把两指贴在下唇，急促地吹了几声犬哨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雪橇犬：</div><div>汪——呜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞驰的步伐踩在松软的雪上，扰乱了最忠诚的朋友们的耳朵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兴奋的犬队带着可怜的无线电小姐一起冲进了石壁迷宫，消失在了眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺谛卡：</div><div>追不上了……这、这可怎么办……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-524601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>乐观地想，它们只是先我们一步穿越了隘口。我们也出发吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犬队的跑动似乎也惊扰到了藏匿起来的生命体，雪地表面开始颤抖起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……？等一下，这里有躲藏起来的魔精！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>果然……司辰，小心！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "10TH-10"}}